{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02882","headline":"九成宫秋初应诏 · 刘禕之","name":"九成宫秋初应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝圃疏金阙，仙台驻玉銮。\n野分鸣鸑岫，路接宝鸡坛。\n林树千霜积，山宫四序寒。\n蝉急知秋早，莺疎觉夏阑。\n怡神紫气外，凝睇白云端。\n舜海词波发，空惊游圣难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禕之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}